# Declare Independence from the GAME menu. Fixture: France 1599 (map_found_colony input.sav) with every French colony's rebel_dividend set to
# 60% of its rebel_divisor, so the SoL is 59% (>= the 50% DECLARE_SOL_MIN gate); the other nations' colonies/units are untouched.
# GAME menu row "DECLARE INDEPENDENCE" (logical y 85) opens the @DECLARE confirm (rows: Never! y 150, Yes! y 162). Yes runs
# FUN_43f7_1a26: the Spanish-succession merger notice (the Crown borrows the emptied Spanish slot), the signing cinematic
# (FUN_43f7_160a: a key/click skips the animation to its end, the next one closes it), then the @INDEPENDENCE letter OK.
# Declaring spends every rebel unit's moves ("This will end our turn") but does not end it: the turn number stays 107 and the REF landing /
# Tory uprising stay out; the map shows View mode with "End of Turn" in the sidebar.
click 22 3               # GAME menu
click 50 85              # DECLARE INDEPENDENCE: Never / Yes confirm
wait 1
click 150 162            # Yes!: WoI, rival slots, congress latch, backup force, Euro withdrawal, REF diplo
wait 2
key Return               # War of the Spanish Succession notice (Spain cedes New Spain to the Dutch)
wait 2
wait 1500               # signing cinematic: a key only finishes the glyph being drawn (FUN_43f7_160a raw 74640-74687), so let the signature run out
key Return               # close the cinematic
wait 2
key Return               # @INDEPENDENCE letter OK
wait 2
